    {
      "id": "89ebe068c1037eef801e0f0dd5d81c7dc2f9becbedbf35a57dbfe132a5a5c9b2",
      "text": "How To Make Codebases AI Agents Love",
      "hash": "90591491b0c0629055e1bdb086a7689081d3f8adf919831d810e245f1d6084cc"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f48c38a459ccb82a0da06a7dfd7f9f7e196a6022c6ac7ef759171efee01cf9d",
      "text": "Learn how deep modules and proper codebase architecture make AI coding more effective. Master software design principles for AI-ready codebases.",
      "hash": "eeb8ae5ecf3d35091e35263c0661f5f97159ea77e2adddc0d4f09066b01bfdd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "58fe0a9a61f747516c53d47a7db7306178187f8809bb2587eff55950d913e80c",
      "text": "How To Use Claude Code Hooks To Enforce The Right CLI",
      "hash": "5572493237be23c97fa34a15a2252d791fa744c0866e12b5672f3cf7da797594"
    },
    {
      "id": "b442988e265321002dab3439293a68c26f5a5a0f7510762ac96f94f32467d7ea",
      "text": "Learn how to use Claude Code hooks to prevent unwanted CLI commands and guide your AI coding agent to use the right tools instead of CLAUDE.md.",
      "hash": "2f4b913d8e98d3501072124db7724be91930424037762db03590a2cdadbc8bf9"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b3ef4959ecc5aa27931f8f8184cec6bbda7012d9cd507ed09a64c8f9e888931",
      "text": "Never Run Claude /init",
      "hash": "c400d82a0dd5436539b5000bf2628b3ffe606d2d0e3a6df65c26c685c66b96a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "aea4545379fd52312caacba1f61269d549e14311848b125bb80d526b3d074559",
      "text": "Learn why auto-generated Claude.md files hurt your coding agents and what to use instead for better performance and lower costs.",
      "hash": "9ed9a5e6543bdffaa343758f098231cad57c8d92350c80f4897d7fb1841c9e11"
    },
